# Every file is checked out with the bytes the repository holds, on every platform. The text files
# are LF, and Git for Windows' default (core.autocrlf=true) turned 525 of the 533 files into CRLF
# on checkout (2026-11-09), the vendored trees and the pinned files among them.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Binary by name, whatever git's guess from their first bytes.
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.pt binary
*.safetensors binary
*.gguf binary
*.mkv binary
*.npy binary
# The vendored code, never converted whatever an editor writes: its bytes are held to numz's and
# TransNetV2's (tools/vendor.py, core/tests/test_detector.py).
core/seedvr2x/vendor/** -text
core/seedvr2x/transnetv2/** -text
